    <informations>Shelly Plus RGBW PM — mounting view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: W B G R I4 I3 I2 I1 ⊥ +.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-plus-rgbw-pm
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_dbb56acf481a8e3766dc3e85823b489e40bc5f6ee6902f5ece2653480d75c730/Plus%20RGBW%20PM.jpg?cb=2289e1fd0172e55a162bf450c9232668
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_635ecf47a2603e10c52fccec51ab6b4de114a30826028d04a69eca5cc3885765/Plus-RGBW-PM-internal-schematics.png?cb=51f0430beb43c964632c723f462410e6
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_84e1b1b479ac0206954dc9939653330e06ca1f9acffd922cc2192986132817ba/Shelly%20Plus%20RGBW%20PM%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf?cb=c552e181aa9d1cfab5bab645b34937f7

Notes:
- Official internal schematic confirms O4/W,O3/B,O2/G,O1/R left-to-right when connector is at top. Body photo is shown upside-down; use this front orientation.

Open points:
- KB explicitly labels Size HxWxD=42x37x12, unlike most standard bodies H37/W42; literal manufacturer axes are retained. KB inches depth0.66 conflicts with12mm; metric12mm is retained.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
